<title>UK: Rheinische Hypo adds 500 mln marks to 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Rheinische Hypo adds 500 mln marks to 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 1.5 billion marks from 1.0 billion marks, joint lead managers Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, Dresdner Kleinwort Benson and DG Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RHEINISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT   *1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    17.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    16.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 1	   MGT/UND    0.6	 SPREAD     +16 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	*0RIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 1.0 BILLION ON 09.JAN.97.</p>
<p>	     **TO BE PRICED.</p>
<p>		 UNDERLYING GOVT BOBL 121</p>
<p>		 OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 726</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
